---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="页面未找到 - Internet Memory"
  description="该页面不存在。"
  canonicalPath="/404"
  indexable={false}
>
  <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-[55vh] max-w-3xl flex-col justify-center px-5 py-16 text-center sm:px-8">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-cyan-800">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">页面未找到</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">当前静态演示仅包含 @demo 档案和 demo 记录。</p>
    <a
      class="mx-auto mt-7 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-slate-700"
      href="/"
    >
      返回首页
    </a>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
